; The one variable: where a texture lands on a PrismMesh. The stepped gradient shows the atlas on a
; prism with its apex at the left (`left_to_right` 0), at the right (1), and on a subdivided, squat
; prism. The other PrismMesh scene draws one flat-coloured prism at 0.5, where the UV is invisible.

